        'config'            => $config,
        'system'            => $config->get('system'),
        'theme'             => $config->get('theme'),
        'site'              => $config->get('site'),
        'uri'               => $this->grav['uri'],
        ...
    ];
```

`system/src/Grav/Common/Twig/Twig.php`, in `processPage()`, where the sandboxed render variables are built (around line 419-429):
```php
